Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:26:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 24/28] d/pimax_p3c: live options from Envision's settings file

IPD offset, view cant, eye calibration and flip and the stick dead zone are
re-read from $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/pimax-p3c/settings.json while the service runs
(files older than the driver instance are ignored; a key there wins over the
environment, null = default).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
